          "a": "The client resolves the server via DNS, opens a connection via a TCP handshake (for TCP-based services), sends a request (HTTP GET, DHCP Discover, LDAP bind, SQL query), the server processes and replies, and session/application layer logic may keep state such as cookies or sessions.",
