          "q": "What commands inspect optical transceiver DOM values and module type?",
          "a": "Use 'show int tend1/1 transceiver | include Wavelength|Temperature|Tx Power|Rx Power' for DOM values and 'show interfaces transceiver | include SFP|QSFP|XFP|PORT' to verify the module in a port.",
