          "q": "What is the VPN technology quick-review summary?",
          "a": "Pick IPsec for encrypting fixed links, GRE over IPsec when you need multicast and routing, DMVPN for dynamic Internet branches, FlexVPN for a unified IKEv2 framework, GET VPN for tunnel-free any-to-any on MPLS, and SSL VPN for remote users.",
          "tag": "Quick Review",
