          "q": "What does the SD-WAN lab bring up and verify?",
          "a": "It brings up the control plane (vManage/vSmart/vBond), onboards vEdge/cEdge routers, and verifies transport tunnels, BFD, and policy, modernizing WAN design with centralized control.",
